From k170 (2026-11-09). docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-25-mcp-hub-design.md, ClaudeHistory section (line ~286), says the per-session metadata is cached "keyed by (path, mtime, size)". The code keeps device, inode, size, mtime and the read offset, and reads a grown file incrementally; run files are cached too, without first prompt (k167); first_prompt is cut (k170). Prose fix, main session lane.

